export anchor LetterpressVictorianStyle:
    number: 73
    screen: TodayMobile
    name: Letterpress Victorian
    idea: The day is set as a Victorian playbill in black and red ink on cream stock, with mixed wood-type headings, fleurons and double rules announcing each task like an act.
    base: light
    palette:
        creamStock: #f4ecd6, the page behind the bill
        billPaper: #faf4e2, the printed sheet and fields
        tint: #ebdfc0, the avatar disc
        blackInk: #1b1712, type, rules and frames
        fadedBrown: #4f4234, meta, project lines and upcoming notices
        vermilion: #a11d17, the second ink for fleurons, overdue, priority, the add button and focus
    type:
        Mixed wood type, changing per entry. Condensed display Impact,
        Haettenschweiler, Arial Narrow Bold, sans-serif in caps for the
        46px wordmark, 22px section heads and every third task name at
        24px. Slab Rockwell, Clarendon, Roboto Slab, Georgia at 700 for the
        26px date, 20px meeting hours and the next task names. Didone
        Didot, Bodoni MT, Big Caslon, Georgia in bold italic for the other
        task names and meeting names at 18 to 21px, and at 10 to 11px caps
        tracked 0.2em for small labels. Body text is Bookman Old Style,
        Palatino, Georgia at 15 to 16px italic.
    layout:
        A centred playbill up to 400px. A 3px black border, a cream gap and
        a hairline make the outer frame, and an inner hairline frame has
        red corner ornaments. Everything is centred. The header has the
        issue line No. 306 and a ringed avatar, The in red italic over
        BRIGHTWORK in wood type, a fleuron row, a double rule, the date in
        slab and Featuring 6 tasks and 2 meetings in italic with the counts
        in red. Section heads sit between twin hairlines. Meetings show a
        boxed hour with morning or afternoon beside the name and length.
        Each task is a centred entry with an ordinal such as The first, the
        name, for and the project, and a notice. The bottom bar sits under a
        double rule with a ringed red round add button.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 10px above and below each entry, 18px before section heads.
    density: Medium and theatrical, with large headings and ornaments between sections.
    corners: Square. Only the avatar, badge and add button are round, each with an extra ring.
    borders: 3px double rules, 1px rules between tasks, dotted rules between meetings, and twin hairlines beside section heads.
    shadows: None on the screen. Buttons use a hard 3px offset ink shadow like a misregistered print.
    icons:
        Printer's ornaments and glyphs. Fleurons ❦ ❧ ✥ divide sections. A
        pointing hand marks the current tab and high priority. Notices pair
        a word with ✦ for Due today, a ring for upcoming, ✓ for Done and ✗
        on a solid red block for Overdue. Nav icons are thin engraved line
        drawings such as a sun for Today.
    focus: A 2px vermilion outline offset 3px with an extra vermilion hairline ring outside.
    tone: A playbill announcer, such as Featuring 6 tasks and 2 meetings, The first and lasting 30 min.
